  "text": "Étar is a minor Irish hero in the legends of the lovely heroine Étain. In some versions he is the father of Étain during her human life. In others he acts as her stepfather or foster father. The Hill of Howth in Dublin bears his name. In Irish that hill is called Benn Étair. His name means great.",
